# at lengths 6 to **11** rather than 6 to 9.  That matters: a window of nine
# arrows does not fit in A_9 at all, so the earlier criterion could not have
# selected one however useful it was, and 208 of these have a window of nine
# arrows or more.  E-025.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

